            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.826,
            0.847,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Think and share situations where it is appropriate to (a) round up, (b) round down, (c) either rounding up or rounding down is okay and (d) when exact numbers are needed."
            }
          ]
        },
